abstract: >-
  A live, openly maintained map of the infrastructure behind AI in Australia
  (data centres, rare-earth mines, refineries, and the energy and water they
  draw), with ownership, approval pathways, and the public contestation forming
  around each site. Part of the Civic Interplay project.
